@startuml Persewaan_Band_Sequence

title Sequence Diagram - Persewaan Band

actor User
actor Admin
participant "Band Page" as View
participant "BandRentalController" as PublicController
participant "BandRentalRequestController" as AdminController
database DB
participant "Invoice Service" as Invoice
participant "Email Service" as Mail

User -> View: Buka daftar band
View -> PublicController: index()
PublicController -> DB: Ambil band tersedia
DB --> PublicController: Data band
PublicController --> View: Tampilkan katalog

User -> View: Isi form sewa band
View -> PublicController: storeRequest(request)
PublicController -> DB: Simpan permintaan pending
DB --> PublicController: Berhasil
PublicController --> View: Redirect ke halaman sukses

Admin -> AdminController: Buka daftar permintaan
AdminController -> DB: Ambil data rental
DB --> AdminController: Data permintaan
AdminController --> Admin: Tampilkan daftar

Admin -> AdminController: Approve request
AdminController -> DB: Update status approved + simpan income
AdminController -> Invoice: Generate invoice
Invoice --> AdminController: File PDF
AdminController -> Mail: Kirim invoice ke user
Mail --> User: Invoice + notifikasi
AdminController --> Admin: Tampilkan pesan sukses

@enduml